{"url": "https://jgcollege.ac.in/", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://jgcollege.ac.in/", "text": "Joya Gogoi College – College Website\nContact us\n+91-9876543210\nprincipal.jgc@gmail.com\nOffice Login\nFaculty Login\nStudent Login\nDigital Diary\nNewsletter\nHome\nAbout Us\nAbout the college\nBest Practices\nAccreditation\nInstitutional Distinctiveness\nInstitutional perspective plan\nAdministration\nPrincipal Desk\nVice Principal\nGoverning Body Members\nStaff\nAcademic\nAdmission Procedure\nCourse Outcomes\nProgram Outcomes\nAcademic Calendar\nCollege Prospectus\nHoliday List\nDepartment\nArts Stream\nDepartment of Assamese\nDepartment of English\nDepartment of History\nDepartment of Education\nDepartment of Economics\nDepartment of Political Science\nScience Stream\nDepartment of Physics\nDepartment of Chemistry\nDepartment of Mathematics\nDepartment of Botany\nDepartment of Zoology\nFacilities\nAuditorium and Conference Hall\nIndoor Stadium and Gym Facility\nCollege Canteen\nScience lab & Computer lab\nICT based resources\nGirls Hostel\nIQAC\nAn introduction\nAQAR\nNotification of formation of latest IQAC\nIQAC members\nMinutes and Action taken reports (2018-2023)\nIIQA\nDVV\nLibrary\nCapt. Jintu Gogoi, Vir Chakra Library\nLibrary Infrastructure\nLibrary Committee\nDIGITAL LIBRARY\nLibrary Audit\nCommittee & Cells\nFeedback\nReports on Feedback received from Students, Teachers and Parents and action taken reports\nOnline data of Feedback received from Students, Teachers and Parents\nLink for submission of Feedback by Student, Teacher, Alumni\nContact Us\nNIRF\nAdmission Portal\nInternship\nINFRASTRUCTURE\nNEP\nLMS\nGALLERY\nVideo Gallery\nPhoto Gallery\n✕\nPRINCIPAL'S MESSAGE\nAt the very beginning, I extend my warm welcome to all the students interested in taking admission into various programmes of Joya Gogoi College. Indeed, you are the prospective students to this newly growing remote rural college of the state. In this context, I take the opportunity to write a few words towards introducing the college. The college is situated by the sides of historic Dhodar Ali and at the geographic icon of greater Khumtai area. Since its very inception in 1991, the college has been imparting quality higher education mostly to students of poor socio-economic background of Khumtai locality and its adjoining areas.\nClick For More\nVISION\nThe vision of Joya Gogoi College is to develop an education system deep rooted in Indian ethos with a goal of transforming the locality into an equitable and vibrant knowledge society by imparting high quality education  for all.\nMISSION\nTo provide affordable quality education by bringing innovation in learning methods and adopting diversified curriculum to develop good, thoughtful, well-rounded graduates with knowledge as well as skills and prepare them to face the challenges of future.\nTo make intellectually alive & socially responsible citizen deep rooted in Indian ethos.\nTo organize various academic activities such as seminars, workshops, educational field tour etc. for quality enhancement of students and the faculties.\nNotifications\nAdvertisement for Principal Post\nJuly 21, 2026\n0\n1st Merit List 2026\nJune 2, 2026\n0\nUG ADMISSION NOTICE 2026\nMay 7, 2026\n0\nHs 1st year merit List 2026\nApril 25, 2026\n0\nAdmission Advertisement\nApril 11, 2026\n0\nClick For more\nEvents\nJune 27, 2023\nPOLULARIZATION OF BASIC SCIENCE AMONG THE STUDENTS OF PRIMARY SCHOOL IN KHUMTAI\nRead more\nJune 10, 2023\nCareer Counselling Programme. Date: 10-06-23, Topic: Enhance your career opportunities with in-deman courses\nRead more\nUpcoming Events\nAdvertisement for Principal Post\nJuly 21, 2026\n0\n1st Merit List 2026\nJune 2, 2026\n0\nUG ADMISSION NOTICE 2026\nMay 7, 2026\n0\nHs 1st year merit List 2026\nApril 25, 2026\n0\nAdmission Advertisement\nApril 11, 2026\n0\nClick For more\nImportant Pages\nLIBRARY\nIQAC\nKKHSOU\nVOCATIONAL & ADD-ON COURSES\nPLACEMENT\nRESEARCH & DE